                                                    <rect key="frame" x="20" y="11.000000000000002" width="344" height="16.666666666666671"/>
                                                    <string key="text">Terms &amp; Conditions and Privacy Policy 
close</string>
                                                    <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" weight="semibold" pointSize="17"/>
                                                    <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                    <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                </label>
                                                <textView clipsSubviews="YES" multipleTouchEnabled="YES" contentMode="scaleToFill" textAlignment="natural" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="DCg-Yt-YsU">
                                                    <rect key="frame" x="20" y="37.666666666666686" width="374" height="686.33333333333326"/>
                                                    <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="systemBackgroundColor"/>
                                                    <string key="text">WHAT INFORMATION WE COLLECT

* Details about your community like number of blocks, flats &amp; amenities.
* Personal information like name and contact details of Management, Residents &amp; Staffs/Maids.
* Invoice and payment details of maintenance &amp; amenity booking charges
* Personal information of users which they share on their sole discretion while posting notices, posts, comments, replies and complaints, etc...
* The daily maintenance data (only if its logged by FM) in the form of daily check list like attendance, water levels, diesel levels, waste disposal etc...

WHAT DO WE USE YOUR INFORMATION FOR

* We (“Uniservice”) do not sell, rent or share any information collected above to third party, without your explicit approval.
* All information is protected with most care using stringent access control and encryption technologies both at transit and storage.
* The information we collect will be used in the following way only to provide you better &amp; uninterrupted service.
* Monitor the usage &amp; performance of application, identify the gaps and improve our quality of service
Provide visibility on maintenance activities of your facility.
* Analysis the trend of data in context of preventive maintenance and alert the management whenever required (only if daily checklist logged by FM).
* Internal use for training purpose. 
YOUR CONSENT 
* By using our application, you consent to this terms &amp; conditions and privacy policy. 
NOTIFICATION OF CHANGES 
* Any change made to these terms will be notified via E-mail and/or while logging in.</string>
                                                    <color key="textColor" systemColor="labelColor"/>
                                                    <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="14"/>
                                                    <textInputTraits key="textInputTraits" autocapitalizationType="sentences"/>
                                                </textView>
